            <!-- 全局搜索浮动结果面板 (不受“隐藏系统项”影响，展示精确分类标签、内联操作及详情跳转) -->
            <Grid x:Name="GlobalSearchOverlay" Grid.Column="0" Grid.ColumnSpan="2" Panel.ZIndex="90"
                  Background="#55000000" Visibility="Collapsed"
                  MouseDown="GlobalSearchBackdrop_MouseDown">
                <Border x:Name="BorderGlobalSearchCard" MaxWidth="480" MaxHeight="185" MinWidth="380"
                        VerticalAlignment="Top" HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="24,8,24,20"
                        CornerRadius="10" Padding="14"
                        Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}"
                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource SurfaceStrokeColorDefaultBrush}"
                        BorderThickness="1"
                        MouseDown="GlobalSearchCard_MouseDown"
                        PreviewMouseWheel="BorderGlobalSearchCard_PreviewMouseWheel">
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                        <!-- 全局搜索分类筛选区（点击搜索框右侧筛选按钮后展开；左侧总控+文字，右侧细分项） -->
                        <Border x:Name="GlobalSearchFilterPanel" Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,10" Padding="10,8" CornerRadius="8"
                                Background="{DynamicResource CardBackgroundFillColorDefaultBrush}"
                                BorderBrush="{DynamicResource CardStrokeColorDefaultBrush}" BorderThickness="1"
                                Visibility="Collapsed">
                            <Grid>
                                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                                </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                                <Border Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,5" Padding="8,4" CornerRadius="6"
                                        Background="{DynamicResource ControlFillColorDefaultBrush}"
                                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource CardStrokeColorDefaultBrush}" BorderThickness="1">
                                    <Grid>
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="92"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <CheckBox Grid.Column="0" x:Name="ChkGlobalGroupStartup" Content="自启项"
                                                  FontSize="12" IsThreeState="True" IsChecked="True"
                                                  MinWidth="0" Padding="4,1,0,1" Margin="2,0,0,0"
                                                  ToolTip="全选或取消自启分类"
                                                  HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                  Click="ChkGlobalGroupStartup_Click"/>
                                        <Border Grid.Column="1" Width="1" Margin="8,2"
                                                Background="{DynamicResource DividerStrokeColorDefaultBrush}"/>
                                        <WrapPanel x:Name="PanelGlobalSearchCategoryFilters" Grid.Column="2" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <CheckBox x:Name="ChkGlobalCatStartupItem" Content="自启程序" IsChecked="True" FontSize="12" MinWidth="0" Padding="4,1,0,1" Margin="0,1,12,1" Click="GlobalSearchFilter_Changed"/>
                                            <CheckBox x:Name="ChkGlobalCatWin32Service" Content="系统服务" IsChecked="True" FontSize="12" MinWidth="0" Padding="4,1,0,1" Margin="0,1,12,1" Click="GlobalSearchFilter_Changed"/>
                                            <CheckBox x:Name="ChkGlobalCatKernelDriver" Content="内核驱动" IsChecked="True" FontSize="12" MinWidth="0" Padding="4,1,0,1" Margin="0,1,12,1" Click="GlobalSearchFilter_Changed"/>
                                            <CheckBox x:Name="ChkGlobalCatScheduledTask" Content="计划任务" IsChecked="True" FontSize="12" MinWidth="0" Padding="4,1,0,1" Margin="0,1,12,1" Click="GlobalSearchFilter_Changed"/>
                                            <CheckBox x:Name="ChkGlobalCatWindowsPolicy" Content="系统策略" IsChecked="True" FontSize="12" MinWidth="0" Padding="4,1,0,1" Margin="0,1,0,1" Click="GlobalSearchFilter_Changed"/>
                                        </WrapPanel>
                                    </Grid>
                                </Border>

                                <Border Grid.Row="1" Padding="8,4" CornerRadius="6"
                                        Background="{DynamicResource ControlFillColorDefaultBrush}"
                                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource CardStrokeColorDefaultBrush}" BorderThickness="1">
                                    <Grid>
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="92"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <CheckBox Grid.Column="0" x:Name="ChkGlobalGroupContextMenu" Content="右键菜单"
                                                  FontSize="12" IsThreeState="True" IsChecked="True"
                                                  MinWidth="0" Padding="4,1,0,1" Margin="2,0,0,0"
                                                  ToolTip="全选或取消右键分类"
                                                  HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                  Click="ChkGlobalGroupContextMenu_Click"/>
                                        <Border Grid.Column="1" Width="1" Margin="8,2"
                                                Background="{DynamicResource DividerStrokeColorDefaultBrush}"/>
                                        <WrapPanel Grid.Column="2" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <CheckBox x:Name="ChkGlobalCatClassicMenu" Content="经典右键" IsChecked="True" FontSize="12" MinWidth="0" Padding="4,1,0,1" Margin="0,1,12,1" Click="GlobalSearchFilter_Changed"/>
                                            <CheckBox x:Name="ChkGlobalCatModernMenu" Content="Win11 右键" IsChecked="True" FontSize="12" MinWidth="0" Padding="4,1,0,1" Margin="0,1,0,1" Click="GlobalSearchFilter_Changed"/>
                                        </WrapPanel>
                                    </Grid>
                                </Border>
                            </Grid>
                        </Border>

                        <TextBlock x:Name="TxtGlobalSearchEmpty" Grid.Row="1"
                                   Text="未找到匹配项目，可尝试搜索名称、路径、发布者、服务名、CLSID 或调整分类筛选"
                                   FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"
                                   HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,36,0,36" Visibility="Collapsed"/>

                        <ListView x:Name="ListViewGlobalSearch" Grid.Row="1" BorderThickness="0" Background="Transparent"
                                  VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizing="True"
                                  VirtualizingPanel.VirtualizationMode="Recycling"
                                  ScrollViewer.VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto"
                                  ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled"
                                  ScrollViewer.ScrollChanged="ListViewGlobalSearch_ScrollChanged">
                            <ListView.ItemContainerStyle>
                                <Style TargetType="ListViewItem">
                                    <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,0,8" />
                                    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
                                    <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
                                    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
                                    <Setter Property="Template">
                                        <Setter.Value>
                                            <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListViewItem">
                                                <ContentPresenter />
                                            </ControlTemplate>
                                        </Setter.Value>
                                    </Setter>
                                </Style>
                            </ListView.ItemContainerStyle>
                            <ListView.ItemTemplate>
                                <DataTemplate>
                                    <Border Padding="14,10" CornerRadius="8"
                                            Background="{DynamicResource CardBackgroundFillColorDefaultBrush}"
                                            BorderBrush="{DynamicResource CardStrokeColorDefaultBrush}"
                                            BorderThickness="1">
                                        <Grid>
                                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                                            <Border Grid.Column="0" Width="40" Height="40" CornerRadius="8"
                                                    Background="{DynamicResource ControlFillColorSecondaryBrush}" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                <Grid HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                    <Image Source="{Binding RealIconSource}" Width="24" Height="24" RenderOptions.BitmapScalingMode="HighQuality"
                                                           Visibility="{Binding HasRealIcon, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}"/>
                                                    <ui:SymbolIcon Symbol="{Binding CategoryIcon}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0078D4"
                                                                   Visibility="{Binding HasRealIcon, Converter={StaticResource InverseHasIconVisibilityConverter}}"/>
                                                </Grid>
                                            </Border>

                                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="12,0,12,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                <WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding DisplayName}" FontSize="14"
                                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                                    <Border Margin="8,0,0,0" Padding="6,1.5" CornerRadius="4" Background="#1A0078D4" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding GlobalSearchTypeLabel}" FontSize="11" Foreground="#0078D4"/>
                                                    </Border>
                                                    <Border Margin="6,0,0,0" Padding="5,1.5" CornerRadius="4" Background="#1A107C41" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding Publisher}" FontSize="11" Foreground="#107C41"/>
                                                    </Border>
                                                    <Border Margin="6,0,0,0" Padding="5,1.5" CornerRadius="4" Background="{DynamicResource ControlFillColorDefaultBrush}" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                            Visibility="{Binding IsMicrosoftOrSystemBuiltIn, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}">
                                                        <TextBlock Text="系统项" FontSize="11" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                                    </Border>
                                                </WrapPanel>

                                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding CommandOrPath}" FontSize="12" Margin="0,3,0,0"
                                                           TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" />

                                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,0,0">
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding StatusSummary}" FontSize="11" Foreground="#0078D4" Margin="0,0,10,0"/>
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding LocationKey}" FontSize="11" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                                                </StackPanel>
                                            </StackPanel>

                                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                <ui:ToggleSwitch IsChecked="{Binding IsEnabled, Mode=TwoWay}" Margin="0,0,8,0"
                                                                 Click="TglStartupItem_Click" Tag="{Binding}"
                                                                 Visibility="{Binding IsBinaryStateCategory, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}"/>
                                                <ComboBox Width="100" Margin="0,0,8,0" FontSize="12" Padding="8,4"
                                                          Visibility="{Binding IsMultiStateCategory, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}"
                                                          ItemsSource="{Binding AvailableStateOptions}"
                                                          SelectedItem="{Binding SelectedStateOption, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                          DisplayMemberPath="Title"
                                                          Tag="{Binding}"
                                                          SelectionChanged="CmbStartupItemState_SelectionChanged"/>
                                                <ui:Button Content="查看详情" Icon="{ui:SymbolIcon Open24}" Appearance="Secondary"
                                                           Padding="10,5" FontSize="12"
                                                           Click="BtnGlobalSearchViewDetail_Click" Tag="{Binding}"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </Border>
                                </DataTemplate>
                            </ListView.ItemTemplate>
                        </ListView>

                        <Border x:Name="GlobalSearchPagerBar" Grid.Row="2" Margin="0,8,0,0" Padding="8,5" CornerRadius="6"
                                Background="{DynamicResource ControlFillColorDefaultBrush}"
                                BorderBrush="{DynamicResource CardStrokeColorDefaultBrush}" BorderThickness="1"
                                Visibility="Collapsed">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                <ui:Button x:Name="BtnGlobalPageFirst" Content="«" Appearance="Secondary" Padding="8,0" Height="28" MinWidth="28" FontSize="12" Margin="0,0,4,0" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" ToolTip="首页" Click="BtnGlobalPageFirst_Click"/>
                                <ui:Button x:Name="BtnGlobalPagePrev" Content="‹" Appearance="Secondary" Padding="8,0" Height="28" MinWidth="28" FontSize="12" Margin="0,0,6,0" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" ToolTip="上一页" Click="BtnGlobalPagePrev_Click"/>
                                <StackPanel x:Name="PanelGlobalPageNumbers" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                <ui:Button x:Name="BtnGlobalPageNext" Content="›" Appearance="Secondary" Padding="8,0" Height="28" MinWidth="28" FontSize="12" Margin="6,0,4,0" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" ToolTip="下一页" Click="BtnGlobalPageNext_Click"/>
                                <ui:Button x:Name="BtnGlobalPageLast" Content="»" Appearance="Secondary" Padding="8,0" Height="28" MinWidth="28" FontSize="12" Margin="0,0,10,0" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" ToolTip="末页" Click="BtnGlobalPageLast_Click"/>
                                <ui:TextBox x:Name="TxtGlobalPageInput" Width="46" MinWidth="46" Height="28" MinHeight="28" MaxHeight="28"
                                            Padding="4,0" Margin="0,0,6,0" FontSize="12" ClearButtonEnabled="False"
                                            Text="1" TextAlignment="Center" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                            ToolTip="输入页码后按 Enter 跳转"
                                            PreviewTextInput="TxtGlobalPageInput_PreviewTextInput"
                                            KeyDown="TxtGlobalPageInput_KeyDown"
                                            LostFocus="TxtGlobalPageInput_LostFocus"/>
                                <TextBlock x:Name="TxtGlobalPageInfo" Text="/ 1 页" FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                    </Grid>
                </Border>
            </Grid>
        </Grid>

        <!-- 规则编辑浮层弹窗 (遵循 Windows 11 原生实心 ContentDialog 规范，动态自适应暗黑/浅色主题) -->
        <Grid x:Name="DialogEditRuleHost" Grid.Row="0" Grid.RowSpan="2" Background="{DynamicResource SmokeFillColorDefaultBrush}" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <Grid Width="480" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <Border CornerRadius="8" Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}" IsHitTestVisible="False" CacheMode="BitmapCache">
                    <Border.Effect>
                        <DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="40" Direction="270" ShadowDepth="10" Opacity="0.35" Color="#000000"/>
                    </Border.Effect>
                </Border>
                <Border CornerRadius="8"
                        Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}"
                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource SurfaceStrokeColorDefaultBrush}"
                        BorderThickness="1" Padding="24">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="编辑规则" FontSize="19" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,16"/>

                    <Border CornerRadius="6" Background="{DynamicResource CardBackgroundFillColorDefaultBrush}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource CardStrokeColorDefaultBrush}" BorderThickness="1" Padding="12" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock x:Name="TxtEditRuleTitle" Text="规则名称" FontSize="14" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}"/>
                            <TextBlock x:Name="TxtEditRuleCategory" Text="类别: Win32服务" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" Margin="0,3,0,0"/>
                            <TextBlock x:Name="TxtEditRuleCommand" Text="C:\Program Files\..." FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,3,0,0"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Border>

                    <TextBlock Text="处置动作" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                    <ComboBox x:Name="CmbEditRuleAction" Margin="0,0,0,14" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" DisplayMemberPath="Title"/>

                    <TextBlock Text="匹配模式" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                    <ComboBox x:Name="CmbEditRuleMode" Margin="0,0,0,24" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch">
                        <ComboBoxItem Content="永久" Tag="PermanentAdaptive"/>
                        <ComboBoxItem Content="仅此版本" Tag="StrictCurrentVersion"/>
                    </ComboBox>

                    <!-- Windows 11 原生对称 50/50 等宽双按钮 -->
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="12" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="0" Content="保存" Appearance="Primary" Height="36" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Click="BtnSaveRuleEdit_Click"/>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="2" Content="取消" Appearance="Secondary" Height="36" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Click="BtnCancelRuleEdit_Click"/>
                    </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </Grid>
        </Grid>

        <!-- 手动新建防护规则弹窗 -->
        <Grid x:Name="DialogCreateRuleHost" Grid.Row="0" Grid.RowSpan="2" Background="{DynamicResource SmokeFillColorDefaultBrush}" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <Grid Width="560" MaxHeight="660" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <Border CornerRadius="8" Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}" IsHitTestVisible="False" CacheMode="BitmapCache">
                    <Border.Effect>
                        <DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="40" Direction="270" ShadowDepth="10" Opacity="0.35" Color="#000000"/>
                    </Border.Effect>
                </Border>
                <Border CornerRadius="8"
                        Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}"
                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource SurfaceStrokeColorDefaultBrush}"
                        BorderThickness="1" Padding="24">
                <Grid>
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                    </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                    <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,14">
                        <TextBlock Text="新建防护规则" FontSize="19" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}"/>
                        <TextBlock Text="支持添加所有弹窗可选规则类型；可选择单个目标文件，或浏览文件夹匹配整个目录。" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" Margin="0,4,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                    </StackPanel>

                    <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="1" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" Margin="0,0,-6,14" Padding="0,0,6,0">
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Text="规则名称 *" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                            <ui:TextBox x:Name="TxtCreateRuleName" PlaceholderText="例如：示例程序自启 / 目标文件夹防护" Margin="0,0,0,12"/>

                            <Grid Margin="0,0,0,12">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="12"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                                <StackPanel Grid.Column="0">
                                    <TextBlock Text="拦截类别 *" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                    <ComboBox x:Name="CmbCreateRuleCategory" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" SelectionChanged="CmbCreateRuleCategory_SelectionChanged">
                                        <ComboBoxItem Content="自启程序" Tag="StartupItem"/>
                                        <ComboBoxItem Content="系统服务" Tag="Win32Service"/>
                                        <ComboBoxItem Content="内核驱动" Tag="KernelDriver"/>
                                        <ComboBoxItem Content="计划任务" Tag="ScheduledTask"/>
                                        <ComboBoxItem Content="系统策略" Tag="WindowsPolicy"/>
                                        <ComboBoxItem Content="经典右键菜单" Tag="ClassicContextMenu"/>
                                        <ComboBoxItem Content="Win11 现代菜单" Tag="ModernContextMenu"/>
                                    </ComboBox>
                                </StackPanel>

                                <StackPanel Grid.Column="2">
                                    <TextBlock Text="处置动作 *" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                    <ComboBox x:Name="CmbCreateRuleAction" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" DisplayMemberPath="Title"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Grid>

                            <TextBlock Text="目标文件或文件夹路径" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                            <Grid Margin="0,0,0,12">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ui:TextBox x:Name="TxtCreateRuleTargetPath" Grid.Column="0"
                                            PlaceholderText="输入程序/DLL/驱动路径，或点击右侧选择文件/文件夹"
                                            TextChanged="TxtCreateRuleTargetPath_TextChanged"/>
                                <ui:Button x:Name="BtnCreateRuleBrowseFile" Grid.Column="1" Content="选择文件" Margin="8,0,0,0" Click="BtnCreateRuleBrowseFile_Click"/>
                                <ui:Button x:Name="BtnCreateRuleBrowseFolder" Grid.Column="2" Content="选择文件夹" Margin="6,0,0,0" Click="BtnCreateRuleBrowseFolder_Click"/>
                            </Grid>

                            <TextBlock Text="匹配模式" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                            <ComboBox x:Name="CmbCreateRuleMode" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Margin="0,0,0,12" SelectionChanged="CmbCreateRuleMode_SelectionChanged">
                                <ComboBoxItem Content="永久（自适应特征 / 文件夹目录匹配）" Tag="PermanentAdaptive"/>
                                <ComboBoxItem Content="仅此版本（严格校验单文件 MD5）" Tag="StrictCurrentVersion"/>
                            </ComboBox>

                            <TextBlock Text="注册表 / 服务 / 任务 / CLSID 位置（可选）" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                            <ui:TextBox x:Name="TxtCreateRuleLocationKey"
                                        PlaceholderText="留空则按目标路径或整个文件夹生效，也可填写如 HKCU\...\Run\App"
                                        Margin="0,0,0,12"/>

                            <TextBlock Text="目标文件 MD5（仅「仅此版本」单文件模式校验，选文件自动计算）" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                            <ui:TextBox x:Name="TxtCreateRuleMd5"
                                        PlaceholderText="选择本地文件后自动提取，文件夹规则无需填写"
                                        Margin="0,0,0,10"/>

                            <Border CornerRadius="6" Background="{DynamicResource CardBackgroundFillColorDefaultBrush}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource CardStrokeColorDefaultBrush}" BorderThickness="1" Padding="10,8" Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                <TextBlock x:Name="TxtCreateRuleMetaHint"
                                           Text="提示：选择文件将自动提取签名、PE 元数据与哈希；选择文件夹则对该目录下所有同类别目标生效。"
                                           FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                            </Border>

                            <TextBlock x:Name="TxtCreateRuleError" Visibility="Collapsed"
                                       FontSize="12" Foreground="#D13438"
                                       TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </ScrollViewer>

                    <Grid Grid.Row="2">
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="12"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="0" Content="创建并保存" Appearance="Primary" Height="36" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Click="BtnSaveCreateRule_Click"/>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="2" Content="取消" Appearance="Secondary" Height="36" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Click="BtnCancelCreateRule_Click"/>
                    </Grid>
                </Grid>
                </Border>
            </Grid>
        </Grid>

        <!-- 外壳扩展深入分析浮层弹窗 (对齐 ContextMenuManager 深入分析结果) -->
        <Grid x:Name="DialogDeepAnalysisHost" Grid.Row="0" Grid.RowSpan="2" Background="{DynamicResource SmokeFillColorDefaultBrush}" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <Grid Width="620" MaxHeight="560" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <Border CornerRadius="8" Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}" IsHitTestVisible="False" CacheMode="BitmapCache">
                    <Border.Effect>
                        <DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="40" Direction="270" ShadowDepth="10" Opacity="0.35" Color="#000000"/>
                    </Border.Effect>
                </Border>
                <Border CornerRadius="8"
                        Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}"
                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource SurfaceStrokeColorDefaultBrush}"
                        BorderThickness="1" Padding="24">
                <Grid>
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                    </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                    <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,12">
                        <TextBlock x:Name="TxtAnalyzeTitle" Text="深入分析结果" FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,6,0,0">
                            <Border Padding="8,2.5" CornerRadius="4" Background="{DynamicResource ControlFillColorDefaultBrush}" Margin="0,0,8,0">
                                <TextBlock x:Name="TxtAnalyzeScene" Text="Shell Extension" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                            </Border>
                            <Border Padding="8,2.5" CornerRadius="4" Background="#1A0078D4">
                                <TextBlock x:Name="TxtAnalyzeProbeBadge" Text="单个处理程序" FontSize="12" Foreground="#0078D4"/>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>

                    <!-- 详细信息卡片 (7行完整定义，不重叠) -->
                    <Border Grid.Row="1" CornerRadius="6" Background="{DynamicResource CardBackgroundFillColorDefaultBrush}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource CardStrokeColorDefaultBrush}" BorderThickness="1" Padding="14" Margin="0,0,0,14">
                        <Grid>
                            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="122"/>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                            <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Text="处理程序文件路径:" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                            <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" x:Name="TxtAnalyzeDllPath" Text="-" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>

                            <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="0" Text="注册表路径:" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                            <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" x:Name="TxtAnalyzeRegPath" Text="-" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>

                            <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="0" Text="处理程序 CLSID:" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                            <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1" x:Name="TxtAnalyzeClsid" Text="-" FontSize="12" Foreground="#0078D4" Margin="0,0,0,6" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>

                            <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="0" Text="数字签名 / 厂商:" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                            <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="1" x:Name="TxtAnalyzePublisher" Text="-" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}"/>
                        </Grid>
                    </Border>

                    <!-- 已解析菜单项区 -->
                    <Grid Grid.Row="2" Margin="0,0,0,14">
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Text="已解析菜单项" FontSize="14" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}"/>
                        <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Text="菜单文字与图标为运行时探测结果；部分自绘或回调扩展可能无法显示全部子项。" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" Margin="0,3,0,8" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                        <Border Grid.Row="2" CornerRadius="6" BorderThickness="1"
                                BorderBrush="{DynamicResource CardStrokeColorDefaultBrush}"
                                Background="{DynamicResource CardBackgroundFillColorDefaultBrush}">
                        <ListView x:Name="ListAnalyzeMenuItems" MaxHeight="165" Padding="4"
                                  BorderThickness="0" Background="Transparent"
                                  ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled"
                                  SelectionMode="Single">
                            <ListView.ItemContainerStyle>
                                <Style TargetType="ListViewItem">
                                    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch"/>
                                    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="8,6"/>
                                    <Setter Property="Margin" Value="2"/>
                                    <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent"/>
                                    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0"/>
                                    <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
                                    <Setter Property="Template">
                                        <Setter.Value>
                                            <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListViewItem">
                                                <Border x:Name="ItemBg" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" CornerRadius="4" Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}">
                                                    <ContentPresenter/>
                                                </Border>
                                                <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                                                    <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                                                        <Setter TargetName="ItemBg" Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                                    </Trigger>
                                                    <Trigger Property="IsSelected" Value="True">
                                                        <Setter TargetName="ItemBg" Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource SubtleFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                                    </Trigger>
                                                </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                                            </ControlTemplate>
                                        </Setter.Value>
                                    </Setter>
                                </Style>
                            </ListView.ItemContainerStyle>
                            <ListView.ItemTemplate>
                                <DataTemplate>
                                    <StackPanel Margin="{Binding IndentMargin}" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                        <TextBlock Text="› " FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Text}" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Verb}" FontSize="11" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}" Visibility="{Binding HasVerb, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </DataTemplate>
                            </ListView.ItemTemplate>
                        </ListView>
                        </Border>
                    </Grid>

                    <!-- 操作按钮栏 -->
                    <Grid Grid.Row="3">
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="6" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="6" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="6" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="6" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="0" Content="定位文件" Appearance="Secondary" Height="34" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Padding="4,0" FontSize="12" Click="BtnAnalyzeOpenExplorer_Click"/>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="2" Content="定位注册表" Appearance="Secondary" Height="34" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Padding="4,0" FontSize="12" Click="BtnAnalyzeOpenReg_Click"/>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="4" Content="属性" Appearance="Secondary" Height="34" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Padding="4,0" FontSize="12" Click="BtnAnalyzeProperties_Click"/>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="6" Content="搜索" Appearance="Secondary" Height="34" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Padding="4,0" FontSize="12" Click="BtnAnalyzeWebSearch_Click"/>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="8" Content="关闭" Appearance="Primary" Height="34" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Padding="4,0" FontSize="12" Click="BtnAnalyzeClose_Click"/>
                    </Grid>
                </Grid>
                </Border>
            </Grid>
        </Grid>

        <!-- 启动项与待审核项详情弹窗 (支持命令行与注册表位置跳转) -->
        <Grid x:Name="DialogItemDetailHost" Grid.Row="0" Grid.RowSpan="2" Background="{DynamicResource SmokeFillColorDefaultBrush}" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <Grid Width="560" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <Border CornerRadius="8" Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}" IsHitTestVisible="False" CacheMode="BitmapCache">
                    <Border.Effect>
                        <DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="40" Direction="270" ShadowDepth="10" Opacity="0.35" Color="#000000"/>
                    </Border.Effect>
                </Border>
                <Border CornerRadius="8"
                        Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}"
                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource SurfaceStrokeColorDefaultBrush}"
                        BorderThickness="1" Padding="24">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock x:Name="TxtItemDetailTitle" Text="项目详情" FontSize="18" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,6,0,14">
                        <Border Padding="6,2" CornerRadius="4" Background="{DynamicResource ControlFillColorDefaultBrush}" Margin="0,0,8,0">
                            <TextBlock x:Name="TxtItemDetailCategory" Text="-" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                        </Border>
                        <Border Padding="6,2" CornerRadius="4" Background="#1A107C41" Margin="0,0,8,0">
                            <TextBlock x:Name="TxtItemDetailPublisher" Text="-" FontSize="12" Foreground="#107C41"/>
                        </Border>
                        <TextBlock x:Name="TxtItemDetailStatus" Text="" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                    </StackPanel>

                    <StackPanel x:Name="PanelItemDetailSourceProcess" Visibility="Collapsed" Margin="0,0,0,12">
                        <TextBlock Text="创建来源进程" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                        <ui:TextBox x:Name="TxtItemDetailSourceProcess" Text="-" IsReadOnly="True" FontSize="12" Padding="10,7"/>
                    </StackPanel>

                    <TextBlock Text="命令行" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                    <Grid Margin="0,0,0,12">
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ui:TextBox x:Name="TxtItemDetailCommand" Grid.Column="0" Text="-" IsReadOnly="True"
                                    FontSize="12" Padding="10,7" Margin="0,0,8,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="1" Content="打开" Appearance="Secondary" Padding="14,7" Icon="{ui:SymbolIcon FolderOpen20}" Click="BtnItemDetailOpenFile_Click"/>
                    </Grid>

                    <TextBlock Text="存储位置" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                    <Grid Margin="0,0,0,20">
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ui:TextBox x:Name="TxtItemDetailLocation" Grid.Column="0" Text="-" IsReadOnly="True"
                                    FontSize="12" Padding="10,7" Margin="0,0,8,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="1" Content="定位" Appearance="Secondary" Padding="14,7" Icon="{ui:SymbolIcon Search20}" Click="BtnItemDetailOpenLocation_Click"/>
                    </Grid>

                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right">
                        <ui:Button x:Name="BtnItemDetailCopyAiPrompt" Content="复制 AI 提示词" Appearance="Secondary" Icon="{ui:SymbolIcon Copy20}" Padding="14,6" Margin="0,0,10,0" Click="BtnItemDetailCopyAiPrompt_Click"/>
                        <ui:Button x:Name="BtnItemDetailManage" Content="管理" Appearance="Secondary" Icon="{ui:SymbolIcon WindowWrench24}" Padding="18,6" Margin="0,0,10,0" Visibility="Collapsed" Click="BtnItemDetailManage_Click"/>
                        <ui:Button Content="关闭" Appearance="Primary" Padding="24,6" Click="BtnItemDetailClose_Click"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </Grid>
        </Grid>

        <!-- 编辑备注浮层弹窗 -->
        <Grid x:Name="DialogEditNoteHost" Grid.Row="0" Grid.RowSpan="2" Background="{DynamicResource SmokeFillColorDefaultBrush}" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <Grid Width="440" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <Border CornerRadius="8" Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}" IsHitTestVisible="False" CacheMode="BitmapCache">
                    <Border.Effect>
                        <DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="40" Direction="270" ShadowDepth="10" Opacity="0.35" Color="#000000"/>
                    </Border.Effect>
                </Border>
                <Border CornerRadius="8"
                        Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}"
                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource SurfaceStrokeColorDefaultBrush}"
                        BorderThickness="1" Padding="24">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="编辑备注" FontSize="18" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                    <TextBlock x:Name="TxtEditNoteItemName" Text="-" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,12" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                    <ui:TextBox x:Name="TxtEditNoteInput" PlaceholderText="输入该菜单项的备注说明（留空表示清除备注）..." AcceptsReturn="True" TextWrapping="Wrap" MinHeight="80" Margin="0,0,0,18"/>
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="12"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="0" Content="保存" Appearance="Primary" Height="36" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Click="BtnSaveNote_Click"/>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="2" Content="取消" Appearance="Secondary" Height="36" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Click="BtnCancelNote_Click"/>
                    </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </Grid>
        </Grid>

        <!-- 日志恢复选项浮层弹窗 -->
        <Grid x:Name="DialogRestoreActionHost" Grid.Row="0" Grid.RowSpan="2" Background="{DynamicResource SmokeFillColorDefaultBrush}" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <Grid Width="480" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <Border CornerRadius="8" Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}" IsHitTestVisible="False" CacheMode="BitmapCache">
                    <Border.Effect>
                        <DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="40" Direction="270" ShadowDepth="10" Opacity="0.35" Color="#000000"/>
                    </Border.Effect>
                </Border>
                <Border CornerRadius="8"
                        Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}"
                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource SurfaceStrokeColorDefaultBrush}"
                        BorderThickness="1" Padding="24">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock x:Name="TxtRestoreDialogTitle" Text="选择恢复方式" FontSize="19" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,14"/>

                    <Border CornerRadius="6" Background="{DynamicResource CardBackgroundFillColorDefaultBrush}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource CardStrokeColorDefaultBrush}" BorderThickness="1" Padding="12" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock x:Name="TxtRestoreTargetName" Text="目标项目" FontSize="14" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                            <TextBlock x:Name="TxtRestoreTargetCategory" Text="类别" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" Margin="0,3,0,0"/>
                            <TextBlock x:Name="TxtRestoreTargetLocation" Text="位置" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,3,0,0"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Border>

                    <TextBlock x:Name="TxtRestoreActionLabel" Text="恢复目标状态" FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                    <ComboBox x:Name="CmbRestoreActionOption" Margin="0,0,0,22" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" DisplayMemberPath="Title"/>

                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="12"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ui:Button x:Name="BtnConfirmRestore" Grid.Column="0" Content="确认恢复" Appearance="Primary" Height="36" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Click="BtnConfirmRestore_Click"/>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="2" Content="取消" Appearance="Secondary" Height="36" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Click="BtnCancelRestore_Click"/>
                    </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </Grid>
        </Grid>

        <!-- Win+X 重命名浮层弹窗 -->
        <Grid x:Name="DialogWinXRenameHost" Grid.Row="0" Grid.RowSpan="2" Background="{DynamicResource SmokeFillColorDefaultBrush}" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <Grid Width="440" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <Border CornerRadius="8" Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}" IsHitTestVisible="False" CacheMode="BitmapCache">
                    <Border.Effect>
                        <DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="40" Direction="270" ShadowDepth="10" Opacity="0.35" Color="#000000"/>
                    </Border.Effect>
                </Border>
                <Border CornerRadius="8"
                        Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}"
                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource SurfaceStrokeColorDefaultBrush}"
                        BorderThickness="1" Padding="24">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock x:Name="TxtWinXRenameTitle" Text="重命名 Win+X 项目" FontSize="18" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,10"/>
                    <TextBlock x:Name="TxtWinXRenameOriginal" Text="" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,12" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                    <ui:TextBox x:Name="TxtWinXRenameInput" PlaceholderText="输入新的显示名称..." Margin="0,0,0,18"/>
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="12"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="0" Content="保存" Appearance="Primary" Height="36" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Click="BtnWinXSaveRename_Click"/>
                        <ui:Button Grid.Column="2" Content="取消" Appearance="Secondary" Height="36" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Click="BtnWinXCancelRename_Click"/>
                    </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </Grid>
        </Grid>

        <!-- WinUI 3 圆角 ContentDialog 通用消息与确认浮层 -->
        <Grid x:Name="DialogContentMessageHost" Grid.Row="0" Grid.RowSpan="2" Panel.ZIndex="1000" Background="{DynamicResource SmokeFillColorDefaultBrush}" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <Grid MinWidth="340" MaxWidth="480" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="32">
                <Border CornerRadius="8" Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}" IsHitTestVisible="False" CacheMode="BitmapCache">
                    <Border.Effect>
                        <DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="40" Direction="270" ShadowDepth="10" Opacity="0.35" Color="#000000"/>
                    </Border.Effect>
                </Border>
                <Border CornerRadius="8"
                        Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}"
                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource SurfaceStrokeColorDefaultBrush}"
                        BorderThickness="1"
                        ClipToBounds="True">
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <Border Grid.Row="0" Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorBaseBrush}" Padding="24,22,24,20">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock x:Name="TxtContentDialogTitle" FontSize="19" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,12"/>
                                <ScrollViewer x:Name="ScrollContentDialogBody" MaxHeight="360" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
                                    <TextBlock x:Name="TxtContentDialogBody" FontSize="14" LineHeight="22" TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}"/>
                                </ScrollViewer>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                        <Border Grid.Row="1" Background="{DynamicResource SolidBackgroundFillColorSecondaryBrush}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource DividerStrokeColorDefaultBrush}" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0" Padding="24,18">
                            <Grid x:Name="GridContentDialogButtons">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition x:Name="ColContentDialogPrimary" Width="*"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition x:Name="ColContentDialogSpacer" Width="12"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition x:Name="ColContentDialogClose" Width="*"/>
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ui:Button x:Name="BtnContentDialogPrimary" Grid.Column="0" Content="确定" Appearance="Primary" Height="34" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Click="BtnContentDialogPrimary_Click"/>
                                <ui:Button x:Name="BtnContentDialogClose" Grid.Column="2" Content="取消" Appearance="Secondary" Height="34" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Click="BtnContentDialogClose_Click"/>
                            </Grid>
                        </Border>
                    </Grid>
                </Border>
            </Grid>
        </Grid>
    </Grid>
</ui:FluentWindow>
